<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <LangVersion>11.0</LangVersion>
    <TargetFramework>netstandard2.1</TargetFramework>
    <PackageId>Mythosia.Integrity</PackageId>
    <Title>Mythosia.Integrity</Title>
    <Authors>JJW</Authors>
    <Company>JJW</Company>
    <Product>Mythosia.Integrity</Product>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <Description>CRC and 8-bit checksum calculation, frame encoding, error detection and payload decoding for byte sequences through a common ErrorDetection API.
Supports CRC8 Classic/Maxim, CRC16 Classic/Modbus/CCITT XModem/DNP, CRC32 Classic, and XOR/NMEA, modulo-256 and two's-complement checksums.
Targets .NET Standard 2.1. See the package README for examples and byte-order behavior.</Description>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>1.2.1
- Make CRC16 and CRC32 lookup-table initialization safe during concurrent first use.
- Reduce repeated enumeration, redundant frame-length checks and CRC8/CRC16 byte-array traversal overhead.
- Remove boxing, marshaling and temporary serialization buffers from CRC16/CRC32 digest packing.
- Preserve the public API, existing calculation results, native byte order and legacy DNP representation.
- Add independent correctness, compatibility and initialization tests, Windows/Linux Debug/Release CI, and corrected executable README examples.
Full release notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia/blob/master/Mythosia.Integrity/RELEASE_NOTES.md</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageTags>CRC CRC8 CRC8-MAXIM CRC16 Modbus XModem DNP CRC32 checksum XOR NMEA modulo-256 two's-complement</PackageTags>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia/tree/master/Mythosia.Integrity</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <Version>1.2.1</Version>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>false</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <AssemblyVersion>1.2.0.0</AssemblyVersion>
    <FileVersion>1.2.1.0</FileVersion>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="..\Mythosia\Mythosia.csproj" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Update="README.md">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
    <None Update="RELEASE_NOTES.md">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
